  "_comment": [
    "A RAW Shopify connector reply, saved verbatim - {data:{orders:{nodes:[...]}}} with",
    "lineItems as connection objects, not arrays. Invented names and dates: a fixture",
    "is committed forever, so it must never carry a real customer.",
    "",
    "It reproduces the shape of a real pull on 2026-07-27, and every part of it is here",
    "because that pull broke something:",
    "  1. lineItems.nodes - iterating the connection yielded the string 'nodes', so a",
    "     pull with four real signs planned ZERO and reported no error.",
    "  2. A Mr & Mrs line carries no colour attribute at all. That became the literal",
    "     'Unspecified', which recolour-sign rightly refuses, halting the whole run.",
    "  3. Order names arrive as '#DM...'. The hash was substituted, not stripped, so",
    "     every file read '_DM37868' and stopped matching the order.",
    "  4. Size Upgrade and add-on lines sit beside the sign line and must be ignored.",
    "  5. Legacy orders still marked unfulfilled carry a sign SKU but no personalisation",
    "     at all. They must be flagged for review, never silently printed."
  ],
